---
title: Compress a PDF without uploading
description: Reduce PDF file size in your browser — metadata cleanup and strong compression modes.
relatedTool: compress-pdf
---

Shrink PDFs before email or upload limits — without sending files to a cloud service.

## Steps

1. Open **Compress PDF**.
2. Upload your document.
3. Pick a mode:
   - **Light** — structure optimization and metadata cleanup (best for text PDFs)
   - **Strong** — rasterizes pages for maximum size reduction (best for scans)
4. Download the compressed file and compare sizes.

## Tips

> **Strong mode:** Strong compression converts pages to images — text may not stay selectable. Use Light mode when you need searchable text.

- Scanned PDFs compress more with **Strong** mode.
- Always preview important documents after compression.

